---
/**
 * Legal page, shared by /legal/ and /hr/pravno/: privacy policy, terms of use and the
 * studio's business details (plan §14).
 * Written to GDPR Art. 13; still to be reviewed by someone qualified (plan §17).
 */
import LabelledRow from '../components/LabelledRow.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import type { Locale } from '../i18n/config';
import { alternatesFor, useTranslations } from '../i18n/utils';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../site.config';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { company, email } = siteConfig;
/** `{email}` in the copy renders as a mailto link. */
const controller = `${company.legalName}, ${company.street}, ${company.postalCode} ${company.city}`;

const copy = {
  en: {
    title: 'Legal — Minimalist',
    heading: 'Privacy, terms and studio details',
    lede: 'This site uses privacy-friendly analytics with no cookies and no personal data, so no consent banner is required. Anything you send through the inquiry form is used only to answer that inquiry.',
    privacyLabel: 'Privacy policy',
    privacy: [
      `The controller is ${controller}, owned by ${company.owner}. For anything about your data, write to {email}.`,
      'Through the inquiry form we receive only what you enter: name, email address, company, role, timeline, budget and the description of your project. Name, email and description are needed to answer you; the rest is optional.',
      'We use it to answer your inquiry and, if you ask, to prepare a proposal. The legal basis is taking steps at your request before entering into a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR). There is no profiling, no automated decision-making and no mailing list, and the data is never sold.',
      'Pages are served by Cloudflare. To deliver them and protect the site from abuse, Cloudflare processes technical data such as your IP address and browser details. The form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to check that a person, not a bot, is sending it. Visits are counted with Cloudflare Web Analytics, which sets no cookies and does not identify you. The only thing stored in your browser is your light or dark theme choice. The legal basis is our legitimate interest in a secure, working site (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).',
      'Three providers process this data for us: Cloudflare, Inc. (hosting, security and analytics), Resend (delivery of form messages) and Apple (iCloud Mail, the mailbox where inquiries arrive). All three may process data outside the EU, mainly in the United States; those transfers rely on the EU–US Data Privacy Framework or standard contractual clauses.',
      'Inquiries are kept for twelve months after the last message, then deleted. If an inquiry leads to an engagement, the correspondence is kept as long as the contract and statutory record-keeping require.',
      `You can ask to access, correct, delete or export your data, to restrict its use, or object to processing based on legitimate interest. Write to {email}; we answer within one month at the latest, usually much sooner. You can also complain to the Croatian Personal Data Protection Agency (AZOP, azop.hr).`,
    ],
    termsLabel: 'Terms of use',
    terms: [
      'Everything published here is general information offered in good faith. It is not a binding offer and not professional advice for a specific situation.',
      'Scope, price, timeline and deliverables of any engagement are agreed only in a signed contract. Where a contract and this site differ, the contract applies.',
      'Text, marks and case material on this site belong to Minimalist unless stated otherwise; client names and figures appear only with the client’s permission. Short excerpts may be quoted with attribution. Links to other sites are not endorsements. Croatian law applies, with the courts in Zagreb having jurisdiction.',
    ],
    detailsLabel: 'Studio details',
    registerValue: 'Crafts Register (Obrtni registar), Republic of Croatia',
    fields: {
      legalName: 'Business name',
      owner: 'Founder',
      address: 'Address',
      oib: 'Personal identification number',
      registrationNumber: 'Business registration number',
      register: 'Register',
      bank: 'Bank',
      iban: 'IBAN',
      email: 'Email',
    },
  },
  hr: {
    title: 'Pravne informacije — Minimalist',
    heading: 'Privatnost, uvjeti i podaci o studiju',
    lede: 'Ova stranica koristi analitiku koja poštuje privatnost, bez kolačića i bez osobnih podataka, pa banner za privolu nije potreban. Sve što pošaljete putem obrasca koristi se isključivo za odgovor na taj upit.',
    privacyLabel: 'Politika privatnosti',
    privacy: [
      `Voditelj obrade je ${controller}, vlasnik ${company.owner}. Za sve u vezi s vašim podacima pišite na {email}.`,
      'Putem obrasca za upit primamo samo ono što unesete: ime, e-adresu, tvrtku, poziciju, rok, budžet i opis projekta. Ime, e-adresa i opis potrebni su da bismo vam mogli odgovoriti; ostalo nije obavezno.',
      'Podatke koristimo za odgovor na upit i, ako to zatražite, za pripremu ponude. Pravna osnova je poduzimanje radnji na vaš zahtjev prije sklapanja ugovora (čl. 6. st. 1. t. (b) GDPR-a). Nema izrade profila, automatiziranog odlučivanja ni mailing liste, a podaci se nikada ne prodaju.',
      'Stranice isporučuje Cloudflare. Kako bi ih isporučio i zaštitio stranicu od zlouporabe, Cloudflare obrađuje tehničke podatke poput IP adrese i podataka o pregledniku. Obrazac koristi Cloudflare Turnstile kako bi provjerio da ga šalje osoba, a ne bot. Posjeti se broje putem Cloudflare Web Analyticsa, koji ne postavlja kolačiće i ne identificira vas. U vašem pregledniku sprema se samo odabir svijetle ili tamne teme. Pravna osnova je naš legitimni interes za sigurnu i ispravnu stranicu (čl. 6. st. 1. t. (f) GDPR-a).',
      'Podatke za nas obrađuju tri pružatelja usluga: Cloudflare, Inc. (hosting, zaštita i analitika), Resend (dostava poruka iz obrasca) i Apple (iCloud Mail, pretinac u koji stižu upiti). Sva tri mogu obrađivati podatke izvan EU-a, uglavnom u SAD-u; ti se prijenosi temelje na Okviru za privatnost podataka EU-a i SAD-a ili standardnim ugovornim klauzulama.',
      'Upiti se čuvaju dvanaest mjeseci od posljednje poruke, a zatim se brišu. Ako upit dovede do suradnje, prepiska se čuva onoliko dugo koliko to zahtijevaju ugovor i zakonske obveze čuvanja dokumentacije.',
      `Možete zatražiti pristup, ispravak, brisanje ili prijenos svojih podataka, ograničenje obrade te uložiti prigovor na obradu koja se temelji na legitimnom interesu. Pišite na {email}; odgovaramo najkasnije u roku od mjesec dana, obično puno brže. Pritužbu možete podnijeti i Agenciji za zaštitu osobnih podataka (AZOP, azop.hr).`,
    ],
    termsLabel: 'Uvjeti korištenja',
    terms: [
      'Sve objavljeno ovdje općenita je informacija dana u dobroj vjeri. Ne predstavlja obvezujuću ponudu ni stručni savjet za konkretnu situaciju.',
      'Obuhvat, cijena, rokovi i isporuke svakog angažmana ugovaraju se isključivo potpisanim ugovorom. U slučaju razlike između ugovora i ove stranice, primjenjuje se ugovor.',
      'Tekst, znakovi i materijali studija pripadaju Minimalistu osim ako je drukčije navedeno; imena klijenata i brojke objavljuju se samo uz njihovo dopuštenje. Kraće citate smijete prenijeti uz navođenje izvora. Poveznice na druge stranice nisu preporuka. Primjenjuje se hrvatsko pravo, uz nadležnost sudova u Zagrebu.',
    ],
    detailsLabel: 'Podaci o studiju',
    registerValue: 'Obrtni registar Republike Hrvatske',
    fields: {
      legalName: 'Naziv obrta',
      owner: 'Vlasnik',
      address: 'Adresa',
      oib: 'OIB',
      registrationNumber: 'Matični broj obrta',
      register: 'Upisan u',
      bank: 'Banka',
      iban: 'IBAN',
      email: 'E-pošta',
    },
  },
} satisfies Record<Locale, Record<string, string | string[] | Record<string, string>>>;

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const text = copy[locale];
const t = useTranslations(locale);

const details = [
  { label: text.fields.legalName, value: company.legalName },
  { label: text.fields.owner, value: company.owner },
  {
    label: text.fields.address,
    value: `${company.street}, ${company.postalCode} ${company.city}, ${t('footer.country')}`,
  },
  { label: text.fields.oib, value: company.oib },
  { label: text.fields.registrationNumber, value: company.registrationNumber },
  { label: text.fields.register, value: text.registerValue },
  { label: text.fields.bank, value: company.bank },
  { label: text.fields.iban, value: company.iban },
];
---

<BaseLayout title={text.title} description={text.lede} alternates={alternatesFor('legal')}>
  <Section bordered={false}>
    <PageHeader title={text.heading} lede={text.lede} compact />

    <div class="block" data-draw>
      <LabelledRow label={text.privacyLabel} sideWidth="200px">
        <div class="prose">
          {text.privacy.map((paragraph) => (
            <p>
              {paragraph
                .split('{email}')
                .map((part, index) => [index > 0 && <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>, part])}
            </p>
          ))}
        </div>
      </LabelledRow>
    </div>

    <div class="block" data-draw>
      <LabelledRow label={text.termsLabel} sideWidth="200px">
        <div class="prose">
          {text.terms.map((paragraph) => (
            <p>{paragraph}</p>
          ))}
        </div>
      </LabelledRow>
    </div>

    <div class="block" data-draw>
      <LabelledRow label={text.detailsLabel} sideWidth="200px">
        <dl class="details">
          {details.map((detail) => (
            <div class="detail">
              <dt>{detail.label}</dt>
              <dd>{detail.value}</dd>
            </div>
          ))}
          <div class="detail">
            <dt>{text.fields.email}</dt>
            <dd>
              <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </LabelledRow>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .block {
    margin-top: clamp(28px, 4vw, 52px);
    padding-top: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);
    border-top: var(--hairline) solid var(--rule);
  }

  .prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 68ch;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .detail {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 10px;
  }

  dt {
    flex: 0 0 200px;
    padding-top: 4px;
    font-size: var(--text-label-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--graphite);
  }

  dd {
    flex: 1 1 240px;
    margin: 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere; /* the IBAN must not push the page wider on phones */
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .prose a,
  dd a {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: var(--hairline) solid var(--rule);
    transition: border-color var(--duration-state) linear;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .prose a:hover,
    dd a:hover {
      border-bottom-color: var(--ink);
    }
  }
</style>
